{"sections":[{"slug":"余纤维列","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"余纤维列"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">余纤维列</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“余纤维列”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">为零对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称序列</span> $A\\to B\\to C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为余纤维列是指</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{ccc}\r\n\tA &amp; \\to &amp; B\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\t0 &amp; \\to &amp; C\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">为推出</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}